+| `wallpaper.source` | Where the picture came from: `desktop` (the desktop's wallpaper), `custom` (picked for the login screen) or `color`. With `desktop`, a greeter may show a user's own synced wallpaper instead. Missing (older shells): treat it as `custom`. |
